<h3>Noise</h3>
<p>Owners generally describe it as quiet at a steady pace. Noise is more likely to come from the machine shifting on the floor than from the flywheel itself. If silence on calls is your priority, compare it with the models in our <a href="/quietest-under-desk-elliptical/">quietest under desk elliptical</a> guide.</p>
<h3>Desk clearance</h3>
