<h3>Chair choice</h3>
<p>A rolling office chair drifts backward every time you push the pedals. Use a chair without wheels, or lock your casters with [[amazon:caster-cups|caster cups]]. An armchair or dining chair works well for evening sessions in front of the TV.</p>

